AltoDaoMintMarket::setAuthorizedController
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when controller is zero address
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when controller is not zero address
        ├── when authorizing a new controller
        │   ├── it should set authorizedControllers to true
        │   └── it should emit SetAuthorizedController event
        ├── when unauthorizing an existing controller
        │   ├── it should set authorizedControllers to false
        │   └── it should emit SetAuthorizedController event
        └── when updating controller status multiple times
            ├── it should update authorizedControllers mapping correctly
            └── it should emit SetAuthorizedController event for each update